# Testing

- Unit tests: Vitest, colocated as `*.test.ts` next to the code. Run with `pnpm test`.
- E2E tests: Playwright in `e2e/`. Run with `pnpm e2e` (starts the app; needs Postgres from `docker compose up -d db`).
- Every change to `src/game/engine/` or `src/scenarios/` needs a unit test.
- Every new page or user flow needs at least one Playwright happy-path test.
- Select elements in E2E by role and accessible name, not CSS classes:

```ts
// Good
await page.getByRole("button", { name: /stay goal-side/i }).click();
// Bad
await page.locator(".choice-btn:nth-child(2)").click();
```

- Before calling work done: `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test`.
